  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Stems of three to five words. Picture lemma of the noun. The right plural sits beside the singular and two obviously wrong endings.",
    "2": "Stems of four to seven words. Mix -s and -es targets, including two-syllable nouns. Distractors swap the ending or keep the singular.",
    "3": "Near-miss spellings on longer stems. Prefer words that already end in s, x, ch, or sh, and two-syllable home or school nouns."
  },
